# Bodies, 96x96. 3/4 view facing right, feet on y = 91, figure about 72 px tall.
# One sprite per race holds head, torso, arms and legs, so no seams between body parts.
# Hair is its own layer (helmets cover it); the front fist is its own layer too, pixel for pixel
# the fist of the body, drawn over the weapon so the fingers wrap the grip.
# Every race shares the silhouette and anchors below the neck:
# HAND_FRONT (63, 62), HAND_BACK (34, 63), HEAD_CENTER (48, 27), NECK (48, 36),
# BACK (44, 42), WAIST (48, 57), FEET (48, 91).
# Pixel by pixel (BITMAP): digits 0-5 skin K, a-f hair H, g-l eyes Y, m-r dark D.


sprite 1 shadow
size 96 96
layer shadow
flags no_outline
ELLIPSE 33 88 30 6 P

